message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "jumpking-rl: a verified Jump King simulator for reinforcement learning"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, numba-accelerated reimplementation of the base game of
  Jump King with Gymnasium environments, batched simulation, O(1) state
  save/restore and tick-exact parity with the original game.
